  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Sheet features on a Lofted Flange's sheet (mitcad#2575): a developed Sheet Cut through a flat facet, a notch at the rectangle's edge, a straight Sheet Cut, a Flange and a Hem on the straight edges of flat facets. The expected areas are worked out apart from the model: the facets' blank (as cli.sheet_lofted_flange's) less the cut-outs, plus the flange's wall and its bend's arc at the K-factor."},
